					"content": "ถ่ายเสร็จแล้ว!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722620202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 722620202,
					"content": "ต่อไปก็...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722620203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 722620203,
					"content": "อืม งั้นเอาอย่างนี้ละกัน! Kichiboushi เคยตกปลามั้ย?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722620204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 722620204,
					"content": "ตกปลา?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722620205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "\"Kichiboushi\""
				},
				{
					"id": 722620205,
					"content": "ท่าทางคงจะยังไม่เคยตก! ป่ะ ไปที่แม่น้ำกัน!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722620206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 722620206,
					"content": "ได้เลย!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "\"Kichiboushi\""
				}
			]
		},
